@startuml SequenceDiagram_Home_Browse_Part1_Client
' Part 1: Client - Home screen & navigation
!theme plain
title Home & Browse - Part 1: Client (Flutter)

skinparam maxMessageSize 100

actor User
participant "MainLayout" as Layout
participant "HomeScreen" as Home
participant "Riverpod" as Prov

== Load Home ==
User -> Layout : Select Home tab
Layout -> Home : build HomeScreen
Home -> Prov : ref.watch(trendingMoviesProvider)
Home -> Prov : ref.watch(recommendedMoviesProvider)
Home -> Prov : ref.watch(genresProvider)
Home -> Prov : ref.watch(countriesProvider)
Home -> Prov : ref.watch(yearsProvider)
Home -> Prov : ref.watch(wishlistMoviesProvider)
Home -> Prov : ref.watch(recentMoviesProvider)
note right of Prov : Each provider triggers\nMovieRepo or Wishlist API
Prov --> Home : async data per section
Home -> User : Trending carousel, Recommended, Explore by Genre/Country/Year, Wishlist, Recently Watched

== Tap movie card ==
User -> Home : Tap poster/card
Home -> Home : context.push(/movie/:id)
Home -> User : MovieDetailScreen

== Tap More ==
User -> Home : Tap "Xem thêm" (More)
Home -> Home : push /movie-type/recommended | wishlist | recent
Home -> User : MovieTypeScreen

== Tap Explore (genre/country/year) ==
User -> Home : Tap genre chip or year
Home -> Home : push /movie-carousel-genre/:slug or /explore/:name or .../year/:y
Home -> User : ExploreGenreDetails / ExploreGenre

@enduml
